  "\\pxi-4,l4;楼梯说明： \\P\\pi0,l0;1.梯板配筋构造详见22G101-2。 \\P2.在梁(框架梁、梯梁)上集中荷载(梯梁、梯柱)处，在主梁内的次梁两侧   各附加2组箍筋，其直径、肢数同主梁箍筋，间距50。\\P3.楼梯构件混凝土强度等级与同楼层梁板等级相同。\\P4.地上梯板下端均采用滑动支座，详节点详图1。\\P5.采用下端滑动支座的梯板，在梯板两侧附加 216纵筋，具体做法详见22G101-2第46页及第48页。\\P6.TZ和TKL抗震等级均为二级。": "\\pxi-4,l4;Staircase Description: \\P\\pi0,l0;1. Stair slab reinforcement details are referred to 22G101-2. \\P2. At concentrated loads on beams (frame beams, stair beams), additional 2 sets of stirrups are added on both sides of the secondary beam in the main beam, with the same diameter and number of limbs as the main beam stirrups, spacing 50.\\P3. The concrete strength grade of staircase components is the same as that of the beams and slabs of the same floor.\\P4. All lower ends of the above-ground stair slabs use sliding supports, refer to node details 1.\\P5. For stair slabs using sliding supports at the bottom, 2 φ16 longitudinal bars are additionally added on both sides of the stair slab, specific practices refer to page 46 and 48 of 22G101-2.\\P6. The seismic grades of TZ and TKL are both level two.",
